---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import waterflow from '../images/waterflow.webp';
import firesmoke from '../images/firesmoke.webp';
import skolapparn from '../images/skolapparn.webp';
import skowint from '../images/skowint.jpg';
---

<Layout title="The Story - Rewild" description="The story of Rewild, and the philosophy behind it.">

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <Nav />

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="bg-white pt-36 pb-24 md:pt-44 md:pb-36">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24">
        <div class="md:order-2 md:sticky md:top-32 self-start">
          <Image
            src={firesmoke}
            alt="Fire smoke"
            width={900}
            densities={[1, 2]}
            class="w-full h-auto aspect-[4/5] object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:order-1">
          <h1 class="font-display font-light text-3xl md:text-4xl text-forest mb-10 leading-tight">
            The story of Rewild
          </h1>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-forest font-light leading-relaxed text-[1.08rem]">
            <p>
              At some point in life I found myself in a place that I no longer had the capacity for.
            </p>
            <p>
              The intensity of challenges left me injured and burnt out.
            </p>
            <p>
              Work felt toxic.
            </p>
            <p>
              My chest was in constant physical pain from accumulated stress and emotions.
            </p>
            <p>
              I felt trapped and isolated.
            </p>
            <p>
              My instincts were telling me to get out.
            </p>
            <p>
              I began to run up local mountains after work - as if to grasp for air while suffocating.
            </p>
            <p>
              In all weather, every season.
            </p>
            <p>
              I welcomed the elements as a gateway into presence.
            </p>
            <p>
              Not a human for kilometers.
            </p>
            <p>
              Sometimes hiking up in deep snow.
            </p>
            <Image
              src={skowint}
              alt="Footprints in deep snow on a mountain ridge at sunset"
              width={900}
              densities={[1, 2]}
              class="w-full h-auto aspect-[3/2] object-cover object-center"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <p>
              It was not easy.
            </p>
            <p>
              My lungs working hard to keep me moving.
            </p>
            <p>
              With each breath, tensions releasing.
            </p>
            <p>
              Every part of my body coming online.
            </p>
            <p>
              Every cell filling with life.
            </p>
            <p>
              Immersing in nature with all of my senses.
            </p>
            <p>
              My nostrils sticking from the frozen air.
            </p>
            <p>
              The occasional hiss of snow crystals flowing from the pines.
            </p>
            <p>
              Cutting through the dead silence.
            </p>
            <p>
              The citrusy aroma of spruce needles in my mouth.
            </p>
            <p>
              Reminding me, that even here I'm surrounded by life.
            </p>
            <p>
              And crystals, everything covered in glitter.
            </p>
            <p>
              I felt overwhelmed by gratitude.
            </p>
            <p>
              With my entire being.
            </p>
            <p>
              For witnessing this.
            </p>
            <p>
              For feeling at home here.
            </p>
            <p>
              And inside of myself.
            </p>
            <p>
              Where spaces inhabited by stress were cleared.
            </p>
            <p>
              Then re-filled with pure life force.
            </p>
            <p>
              Again and again, and again.
            </p>
            <p>
              Even though physically challenging, the trips became addictive.
            </p>
            <p>
              They left me with joy, peace and deep appreciation of being alive.
            </p>
            <p>
              In awe of the incredible beauty of nature.
            </p>
            <p>
              Singing while walking home.
            </p>
            <p>
              The effects lingered.
            </p>
            <p>
              My capacity to deal with stress in daily life expanded.
            </p>
            <p>
              My perspective shifted.
            </p>
            <p>
              Resilience increased.
            </p>
            <p>
              I was wildly inspired to share these tools with the world.
            </p>
            <p>
              This turned out to be the very first, organic form of the <a href="/evening-reset" class="font-semibold underline decoration-forest/40 hover:decoration-forest transition-colors duration-200">Evening Reset</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
              Now more refined, accessible, and constantly evolving.
            </p>
            <p>
              With you.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Philosophy -->
  <section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-36">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24 items-stretch">
        <div class="md:order-1 min-h-[400px]">
          <Image
            src={waterflow}
            alt="Connected with the earth"
            width={900}
            densities={[1, 2]}
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:order-2">
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-4xl md:text-5xl text-forest mb-10 leading-tight">
            You were built for this
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-forest font-light leading-relaxed text-[1.08rem]">
            <p>
              Step into nature and within minutes, cortisol begins to drop, the mind quietens, and the nervous system shifts into repair mode.
            </p>
            <p>
              Time in nature does more than relax you; it restores you.
            </p>
            <p>
              Picture yourself being in a forest.
            </p>
            <p>
              The sweet scent of the earth.
            </p>
            <p>
              The sound of leaves all around.
            </p>
            <p>
              It feels good, doesn't it?
            </p>
            <p>
              Being among trees lowers anxiety, sharpens memory, and boosts immunity.
            </p>
            <p>
              Water revitalises, sunlight regulates sleep, and being outdoors actually makes social interactions easier.
            </p>
            <p>
              Your body carries millions of years of adaptation to the natural environment.
            </p>
            <p>
              To move freely, rest deeply and feel fiercely alive.
            </p>
            <p>
              As distant as it may seem, that capacity is still within you.
            </p>
            <p>
              Rewild is about waking it up.
            </p>
            <p>
              By reminding you of <em>your</em> nature.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Evening Reset -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 md:py-36">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <div class="max-w-md mx-auto">
        <a href="/evening-reset" class="bg-cream group overflow-hidden block cursor-pointer">
          <div class="overflow-hidden h-72">
            <Image
              src={skolapparn}
              alt="Evening Reset - forest hike"
              width={1200}
              densities={[1, 2]}
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-sage mb-3 font-light">Hike & movement</p>
            <h3 class="font-display font-light text-3xl text-forest mb-5 leading-tight">Evening Reset</h3>
            <p class="text-forest font-light text-[1.08rem] leading-relaxed mb-8">
              A weekly evening hike designed to help you release stress, build core strength, and move with greater awareness. Explore a new trail each week, in all weather and every season.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-5 border-t border-white">
              <span class="inline-block text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light text-forest group-hover:text-sage transition-colors duration-300">
                Learn more →
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <Footer />

</Layout>
